Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the absence of proper clock configuration for the SP804 timers, which were not receiving the correct clock sources from the SP810 system controller. This resulted in incorrect timer clock frequencies and functionality, as the SP804 driver was not enabled on ARM64 due to its reliance on the SP810 for clock management.

